    rows:[['Digital identity','National Identification Number (NIN), National Identity Management Commission (NIMC): enrolment reached 136 million (Jul 2026); NIMC Act 2026 makes the NIN the foundational identifier and NIMC the root certification authority; World Bank-supported ID4D project (US$430m with AFD and EIB) had about 121 million NINs and about 45.6% undisbursed at end-Sep 2026, and Nigeria has asked for a third extension to Dec 2027','op'],['Digital payments','NIBSS Instant Payments: e-payments worth ₦1.07 quadrillion in 2024; new ISO 20022 National Payment Stack had processed 26.55 million transactions worth ₦1.4 trillion across 48 institutions (Aug 2026); eNaira CBDC (2021) little used, with most wallets inactive','op'],['Data exchange','Galaxy Backbone designated as the Government Data Exchange Platform and interoperability layer under an OSGF circular (Aug 2025); NIMC says linking NIN with bank, SIM, passport and voter records is held back by weak inter-agency collaboration','part'],['Civil registration (CRVS)','National Population Commission VitalReg online birth and death registration nationwide since 1 Jul 2026, sign-up with NIN; birth registration coverage about 57%, death registration under 20%','part'],['Business registry','Corporate Affairs Commission (CAC): fully digital, end-to-end registry with an AI-driven portal; close to 10,000 registration requests a day (Feb 2026)','op'],['Government services portal','Government Service Portal (services.gov.ng) with single sign-on, built with KOICA and Galaxy Backbone; pilot with some government institutions (Jul 2026)','part'],['Data protection','Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 (signed 12 Jun 2023) created the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC); General Application and Implementation Directive (GAID) 2025 in effect from 19 Sep 2025, replacing the NDPR 2019','law'],['Cybersecurity','Cybercrimes (Prohibition, Prevention, etc.) Act 2015, amended 2024 (signed 28 Feb 2024); ngCERT in the Office of the National Security Adviser; National Cybersecurity Policy and Strategy 2021','law'],['AI governance','National AI Strategy launched Apr 2025 (12 goals, 34 initiatives, five pillars; adopted as a living document, Sep 2025); an AI governance framework is being developed; no AI law','part']],
